# Global excludes. Git uses this path by default as core.excludesFile, so
# nothing has to point at it.
#
# Keep this list short and personal. Anything a collaborator would also need
# belongs in the repository's own .gitignore -- rules here are invisible to
# everyone else, so a file ignored only by this list looks, to them, like a file
# you simply forgot to commit.

# vim swap files
*.sw[0-1a-z]
